<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><documents xmlns:xsi = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation = "HDocumentSchema.xsd"><document type = "H"><pnldref>H355</pnldref><english><title>Unqualified person acting as solicitor</title><additionalkeywords><additionalkeyword>20</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>SOLICITORS ACT 1974</additionalkeyword></additionalkeywords><standardoffencewording>On **(..SPECIFY DATE..) at **(..SPECIFY TOWNSHIP..) being an unqualified person, acted as a solicitor in a civil or criminal cause or matter</standardoffencewording><legislation>Contrary to section 20 of the Solicitors Act 1974.</legislation><pointstoprove>date and location&lt;br /&gt; being an unqualified person&lt;br /&gt; acted as a solicitor&lt;br /&gt; in any civil/criminal cause/matter</pointstoprove><investigatoractions><investigatoraction><code>IA1</code><description>Fingerprint and photograph</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA2</code><description>DNA Samples: If crime scene stain present - take evidential sample If no crime scene stain and DNA not confirmed on PNC - take Criminal Justice sample. If DNA confirmed on PNC - CJ sample not required</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA27</code><description>Confirm proposed charge is appropriately authorised (Police or CPS)</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA28</code><description>Ensure compliance with investigator's obligations re disclosure</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA29</code><description>Consider if case suitable for referral to Financial Investigation Unit and CPS for asset recovery eg confiscation order</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA3</code><description>Audio record interview unless exempt</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA4</code><description>PNC recordable</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA5</code><description>Submit a crime report</description></investigatoraction><investigatoraction><code>IA6</code><description>Offences brought to justice scheme</description></investigatoraction></investigatoractions><policeandcpschargingresponsibilities>D27968</policeandcpschargingresponsibilities><notes>(i)  No person shall be qualified to act as a solicitor unless his name is on the roll - i.e. the list of solicitors kept in accordance with section 6(1) of the Act - and he has in force a practising certificate (section 1) and a person who is not qualified is referred to in this part as an "unqualified person".&lt;br /&gt; (ii) There may be an additional punishment for contempt of court. Also the Law Society may bring proceedings against the defendant for an additional penalty</notes></english><indictment><indictmentindicator><code>N</code><description>No</description></indictmentindicator><structuredindictmentindicator><code>N</code><description>No</description></structuredindictmentindicator></indictment><other><powersofarrest>Arrest without warrant</powersofarrest><modeoftrial><code>IND</code><description>INDICTABLE</description></modeoftrial><timelimitforprosecutions>None</timelimitforprosecutions><penalty>Two years imprisonment and / or a fine.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Time limit for prosecutions:&lt;br /&gt; None</penalty><geographicregion><code>EW</code><description>England and Wales</description></geographicregion></other><codes><cjsoffencecode>SO74001</cjsoffencecode><recordableonpncindicator><code>Y</code><description>Yes</description></recordableonpncindicator><pncacpooffencecode>8.22.4.1</pncacpooffencecode><notifiabletoho><code>Y</code><description>Yes</description></notifiabletoho><hoclassification>099/99</hoclassification><mopireviewgroup><code>C</code><description>Group 3</description></mopireviewgroup><mopinoteslink>D19586</mopinoteslink><disqualificationclass><code>N</code><description>discretionary disqualification not endorsable</description>